[00:00.57]Lesson 81 | 第81课
[00:03.05]Roast beef and potatoes | 烤牛肉和土豆
[00:06.92]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.41]Why is Carol disappointed? | 卡罗尔为什么失望?
[00:17.01]Hi, Carol! Where's Tom? | 嗨,卡罗尔!汤姆在哪里?
[00:20.33]He's upstairs. | 他在楼上。
[00:22.39]He's having a bath. | 他正在洗澡。
[00:24.60]Tom! | 汤姆!
[00:26.78]Yes? | 什么事?
[00:28.28]Sam's here. | 萨姆来了。
[00:30.15]I'm nearly ready. | 我马上就好。
[00:32.84]Hello, Sam. | 你好,萨姆。
[00:34.69]Have a cigarette. | 抽支烟吧。
[00:36.59]No, thanks, Tom. | 不,谢谢,汤姆。
[00:39.06]Have a glass of whisky then. | 那就来杯威士忌吧。
[00:41.70]OK. | 好的。
[00:42.58]Thanks. | 谢谢。
[00:44.18]Is dinnner ready, Carol? | 卡罗尔,晚饭准备好了吗?
[00:47.84]It's nearly ready. | 快好了。
[00:50.12]We can have dinner at seven o'clock. | 我们可以在七点吃晚饭。
[00:54.80]Sam and I had lunch together today. | 我和萨姆今天一起吃了午饭。
[00:58.63]We went to a restaurant. | 我们去了一家餐馆。
[01:01.30]What did you have? | 你们吃了什么?
[01:03.42]We had roast beef and potatoes. | 我们吃了烤牛肉和土豆。
[01:07.49]Oh! | 哦!
[01:08.71]What's the matter, Carol? | 卡罗尔,怎么了?
[01:11.05]Well, you're going to have roast beef and potatoes again tonight! | 嗯,你们今晚又要吃烤牛肉和土豆了!